{"words": [{"text": "إِنَّ", "translation": "Indeed"}, {"text": "ٱلَّذِينَ", "translation": "those who"}, {"text": "يَكْتُمُونَ", "translation": "conceal"}, {"text": "مَآ", "translation": "what"}, {"text": "أَنزَلْنَا", "translation": "We revealed"}, {"text": "مِنَ", "translation": "of"}, {"text": "ٱلْبَيِّنَـٰتِ", "translation": "the clear proofs"}, {"text": "وَٱلْهُدَىٰ", "translation": "and the Guidance"}, {"text": "مِنۢ", "translation": "from"}, {"text": "بَعْدِ", "translation": "after"}, {"text": "مَا", "translation": "[what]"}, {"text": "بَيَّنَّـٰهُ", "translation": "We made clear"}, {"text": "لِلنَّاسِ", "translation": "to the people"}, {"text": "فِى", "translation": "in"}, {"text": "ٱلْكِتَـٰبِ ۙ", "translation": "the Book "}, {"text": "أُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ", "translation": "those"}, {"text": "يَلْعَنُهُمُ", "translation": "curses them"}, {"text": "ٱللَّهُ", "translation": "Allah"}, {"text": "وَيَلْعَنُهُمُ", "translation": "and curse them"}, {"text": "ٱللَّـٰعِنُونَ", "translation": "the ones who curse"}], "sahih": "Indeed, those who conceal what We sent down of clear proofs and guidance after We made it clear for the people in the Scripture - those are cursed by Allāh and cursed by those who curse,1"}